def bi(zh,en):return '<div class="bilingual"><div class="lang-zh"><p>'+zh+'</p></div><div class="lang-en"><p>'+en+'</p></div></div>\n'
def title(zh,en,level=2):return f'<h{level}><span class="lang-zh">{zh}</span><span class="lang-en">{en}</span></h{level}>\n'
def sec(zh,en,content,cls=''):return '<section'+(f' class="{cls}"' if cls else '')+'>'+title(zh,en)+content+'</section>\n'
def code(file,label):return f'<pre data-language="{label}" data-kind="'+('teaching' if file.endswith('.sql') else 'pseudocode')+f'" data-source="{file}"><code>'+escape((root/'examples/ch25'/file).read_text().rstrip(),quote=True)+'</code></pre>\n'
def details(zh,en,body):return '<details><summary><span class="lang-zh">'+zh+'</span><span class="lang-en">'+en+'</span></summary>'+body+'</details>\n'
body=''
body+=sec('本章核心：时间到了，也必须有可恢复的工作','Core: a due time needs recoverable work',bi('先分清三次成功：<strong>202 是定义持久保存；T1 是火点已物化；run succeeded 是业务端给出确定结果。</strong>一行 run 仍可能有多个 attempt，worker accepted 更不是通知已经送达。主线是「时间索引 → 唯一火点 → 租约代次 → 稳定业务键」。','Separate three successes: <strong>202 means a durable definition; T1 means a materialized occurrence; succeeded means a confirmed business result.</strong> One run may have several attempts, and worker acceptance does not establish notification delivery. Follow time index → unique occurrence → lease generation → stable business key.')+bi('范围是单地域、多实例的 cron 与一次性延迟任务，例子为对账、巡检和延迟关单。依赖编排另用工作流；先回答允许迟到多久、能否丢窗口、是否允许不同火点重叠、效果在哪个存储提交。','Scope is one region with multiple instances, recurring cron and one-shot delays, illustrated by reconciliation, checks and order closure. Workflows own dependencies. Clarify allowed lateness, whether intervals may be dropped, overlap across occurrences and where effects commit.'),'goal')
assumptions=re.search(r'<table><thead>[\s\S]*?</table>',original).group()
body+=sec('边界与教学容量','Scope and assumed capacity',bi('基线采用一个权威事务库：10,000 个定义在压力例中全部每分钟触发；均值 0.2 秒、60% 使用率预算对应 <strong>56 个整池并发槽</strong>。执行租约 30 秒、心跳 10 秒、业务调用超时 20 秒，最多 5 次自动尝试。另一个恢复例只补十个 job，不能把两种负载相加后继续沿用原预算。','Use one authoritative transactional database. In the stress case all 10,000 definitions fire each minute; 0.2 s mean service and a 60% utilization budget imply <strong>56 pool slots</strong>. Leases last 30 s, heartbeats 10 s, business-call timeout 20 s, with at most five automatic attempts. A separate recovery example covers ten jobs; it does not share the stress case’s load assumptions.')+details('展开完整假设、保留与时间口径','Full assumptions, retention and time conventions',assumptions)+bi('认领和完成只访问权威主库；故障切换不得回退已确认的任务、run 和业务去重记录。副本数不是耐久保证。主库不确定时暂停新认领，展示 due lag，而不是从副本猜所有者。','Claims and completion use the authoritative primary. Failover must preserve acknowledged schedules, runs and business deduplication records; copy count alone is not durability. Without a safe authority, pause claims and expose due lag rather than infer ownership from replicas.'))
body+=sec('T1：同事务保存火点与下一游标','T1: commit the occurrence and next cursor together',bi('注册 API 在定义、版本与注册幂等回执同库提交后返回 202；认证及同键冲突沿用 Ch09 模式。以下实现从已验证定义开始。第一组图的关键是：<strong>推进 next_run_at 时，必须留下持久 ready 行</strong>，再发 worker。提交后发送前崩溃就扫 ready；发送后丢确认就重投同一个 run_id。需要队列时在 T1 加 dispatch outbox，由 relay 恢复投递。','The registration API returns 202 after definition, version and registration receipt commit together, using Ch09’s authentication and same-key conflict model. The code begins with validated definitions. Deck one’s key rule is to <strong>leave a durable ready row when advancing next_run_at</strong>, then dispatch. A crash before delivery re-scans ready; a lost delivery ACK resends run_id. A queue variant adds a dispatch outbox inside T1, relayed after commit.')+figs[0]+title('身份与输入都冻结在 run','Freeze identity and input in the run',3)+bi('非空唯一键是 (job_id, schedule_version, scheduled_at UTC)，而不是机器当前时间。改版只影响后续物化；已有 run 的处理参数与 effect_key 不随最新 job 改变，claim 也不再从 job 取新参数。业务键按意图选，例如同一租户下 close:o7；不能默认每次新 schedule_version 都代表可再做一次业务效果。[3]','The non-null unique key is (job_id, schedule_version, scheduled_at UTC), rather than a machine’s current time. Edits affect future materialization; an existing run keeps its frozen input and effect_key, and claims do not reload new job parameters. Choose effect identity by business intent, such as tenant-scoped close:o7. A new schedule version does not automatically authorize another effect. [3]')+code('schema.sql','SQL · PostgreSQL 18 teaching schema')+bi('下列伪代码对应第 2/4 帧。PostgreSQL 18 的 SKIP LOCKED 适合队列表多消费者，读到的是不完整视图；行锁在事务结束释放，它只保护这次物化，不能替代执行租约。[1][2]','This pseudocode implements frames 2/4. PostgreSQL 18 SKIP LOCKED suits consumers of a queue-like table but gives an incomplete view. Row locks end with the transaction; they protect materialization, not handler execution. [1][2]')+code('materialize.pseudo','Pseudocode · durable occurrence')+bi('calendar 适配器必须按固定表达式、IANA 时区、时区规则版本和 DST 策略枚举原计划，返回严格递增 UTC 火点；一次性任务返回 null 下一火点。freeze_input_and_business_key 只做确定性纯计算。冲突只忽略 occurrence 约束，随后比较冻结输入；其他数据库错误回滚，不能一律当重复。未知 COMMIT 要丢弃连接、从主库重读游标与行，不从未确认提交的内存结果发 RPC。','The calendar adapter enumerates the original expression, IANA timezone, pinned timezone rules and DST policy as strictly increasing UTC instants; one-shot jobs have a null next occurrence. freeze_input_and_business_key is deterministic pure computation. Only the occurrence conflict is handled as replay, with frozen-input comparison; other database errors roll back. An unknown COMMIT requires discarding the connection and re-reading primary state, not dispatching from unconfirmed memory.')+bi('cron 按日历推进，不等待上次成功；fixed delay 才是 finished_at 加间隔。当前示例允许不同火点重叠；若业务要求串行，必须再用 job 级活动指针或并发槽，并与 claim 同事务校验。暂停定义只停止后续物化，已有 ready/running 不会自动取消。','Cron advances calendar instants without waiting for the previous success; fixed delay derives the next time from finished_at. This example permits distinct occurrences to overlap. Serial execution needs a job-level active pointer or slot checked with the claim transaction. Pausing a definition stops future materialization; existing ready/running runs are not automatically cancelled.'))
capacity=bi('10,000 ÷ 60 = 166.666…/s；乘 0.2 秒得均值占用 33.333… 槽，再除以 0.6 并向上取整为 56。固定每次 0.2 秒且无额外开销时，56 槽吞吐 280/s，流体下界是 35.714… 秒，离散轮次是 ceil(10,000÷56)=179，完成要 35.8 秒。五秒完成的理想并发至少 400；若仍按 60% 预算预留，则约 667，尚未算认领和排队。','10,000 / 60 = 166.666…/s; multiplying by 0.2 s gives 33.333… occupied slots, then dividing by 0.6 and rounding up gives 56. With fixed 0.2 s runs and no overhead, 56 slots supply 280/s. The fluid lower bound is 35.714… s, while ceil(10,000/56)=179 discrete rounds take 35.8 s. Five-second completion needs at least 400 ideal slots, or about 667 at the same 60% budget, before claims and queueing.')+bi('定义：10,000×1 KB=10 MB，三份 30 MB。run：10,000×1,440=14.4M/天；14.4M×200 B×7=20.16 GB，三份 60.48 GB。均为十进制原始行估算，未算索引、WAL、attempt 审计、结果和备份；只清终态历史，不清 ready/running/retry_wait/review 或仍需保护的业务键。','Definitions: 10,000×1 KB=10 MB, or 30 MB for three copies. Runs: 10,000×1,440=14.4M/day; 14.4M×200 B×7=20.16 GB, or 60.48 GB for three copies. These decimal raw-row estimates exclude indexes, WAL, attempt audits, results and backups. Clean terminal history only, preserving ready/running/retry_wait/review work and still-needed effect keys.')
body+=sec('容量：平均速率与整分钟突发分开','Capacity: distinguish average rate from aligned bursts',bi('166.7/s 只是平均；整分钟会同时出现 10,000 个 due。100 行一批要 100 批事务，但批量不代表执行吞吐。第二组的 16 个稳定逻辑片只分摊扫描，不是 16 个数据库；迁移时允许重叠扫描，最终仍由行锁与唯一身份收口。','166.7/s is an average; a minute boundary can make 10,000 rows due together. Batches of 100 need 100 transactions without establishing execution throughput. Deck two’s 16 stable logical shards divide scans, not databases; overlapping scans during reassignment still rely on row locks and unique identity.')+figs[1]+details('展开并发、突发下界与存储算式','Slot, burst and storage arithmetic',capacity)+bi('指标分别看 due lag、最老 ready 年龄、过期租约、claim 拒绝与下游错误。开始迟到 = 实际开始 − scheduled_at；业务完成还要加 handler 时间。1 秒轮询只贡献检测延迟的一部分。扫描慢才扩 scanner；执行或下游预算不足时，更多 scanner 只会更快地产生积压。','Track due lag, oldest ready age, expired leases, rejected claims and downstream errors separately. Start lateness is actual start minus scheduled_at; completion also includes handler time. One-second polling covers only part of detection latency. Add scanners for scanning limits; execution/downstream bottlenecks otherwise create backlog faster.'))
body+=sec('执行租约：代次保护状态，业务端保护效果','Execution lease: generations protect state; receivers protect effects',bi('第三组保留最重要的反例：A 暂停到第 31 秒，B 接管同一个 r7，代次从 41 到 42；A 仍会醒来发送旧请求。<strong>租约过期不杀进程，代次也不自动传遍远程系统。</strong>保护资源必须参与拒绝旧权利。[4]','Deck three retains the key counterexample: A pauses until second 31, B takes over r7 and advances generation 41→42, and A can still resume sending requests. <strong>Expiry does not kill a process or automatically fence remote systems.</strong> The protected resource must enforce stale-authority rejection. [4]')+figs[2]+title('领取：短事务，事务外执行','Claim briefly, execute outside the transaction',3)+bi('输入是持久 run_id 与唯一 owner（进程 boot UUID + 本次 claim UUID），输出是已提交代次、租约和冻结参数。ready、到点的 retry_wait 或已过期 running 才可领取；每次合法领取都计 attempt，包括崩溃接管，不能因没有调用结果而无限重置次数。','Input is a durable run_id and unique owner (process boot UUID plus claim UUID); output is a committed generation, lease and frozen input. Only ready, due retry_wait or expired running is eligible. Every claim counts as an attempt, including crash takeover; missing results do not reset the budget.')+code('claim.pseudo','Pseudocode · claim with generation')+bi('租约判定要在取得保护行锁之后采样实际 DB 时间。PostgreSQL 的 now()/CURRENT_TIMESTAMP 固定在事务起点；若先采样、再等锁，旧时间可能把已过期租约误判为有效。本例锁后取 clock_timestamp()，取样、判断、更新期间不做 RPC。[12] 判定在持锁期间序列化；不声称物理 COMMIT 落盘瞬间仍在租约内，若数据库事务异常挂起，接管必须等该事务结束。','Sample actual database time after acquiring the protected row lock. PostgreSQL now()/CURRENT_TIMESTAMP uses transaction-start time: sampling before waiting can admit an already expired lease. This example calls clock_timestamp() after locking, with no RPC between sampling and update. [12] Decisions serialize while locked; this does not claim the lease is still valid at physical commit. A stuck database transaction also blocks takeover until it ends.')+title('心跳、完成、超时与取消走同一状态门','One state gate for heartbeat, completion, timeout and cancellation',3)+bi('下列伪代码把错误分支写在同一处。心跳与完成必须匹配 running、owner、generation 及锁后取样时尚未到期的 lease；超时保留 effect_unknown，退避后仍用同一业务键。backoff 有上限并加入抖动，执行还受共享下游预算约束；reaper 与直接过期接管是可竞争的恢复路径，由同一行锁串行。','The following pseudocode keeps failure branches together. Heartbeat and completion require running, matching owner/generation and an unexpired lease at the locked sample time. Timeout retains effect_unknown and retries the same business key after bounded backoff with jitter, subject to shared downstream admission. A reaper and direct expired takeover are competing recovery paths serialized on the same row.')+code('transition.pseudo','Pseudocode · lease transitions')+bi('20 秒 RPC 超时只结束本地等待，不证明订单未关闭；5 次耗尽进入持久 review，可能仍有未知效果。只有业务适配器验证同租户、同操作键和冻结输入的确定结果才能 complete；accepted、网络超时、查不到尚未提交行都不是该证据。失去租约就停止发新动作，已发在途动作仍靠接收端幂等。','A 20 s RPC timeout ends local waiting without proving the order remained open. Five exhausted attempts enter durable review, possibly with unknown effects. complete requires the business adapter to verify a durable result for the same tenant, operation key and frozen input; acceptance, timeouts or absence of an uncommitted row are insufficient. Stop new actions after losing authority; receiver idempotency still protects in-flight actions.')+bi('取消未尝试 ready 可落 cancelled；取消 running 只记请求并合作停止，确定效果仍可完成；retry_wait 有过执行尝试则转 review，不能冒充「从未执行」。review 的查证/人工处理使用原键并留审计，本示例不实现完整人工控制台。单 run 的代次不是跨 job 的资源 fence；需要保护共享资源时另建同域单调令牌并由资源验证。','An unattempted ready run may become cancelled. Running cancellation records a cooperative request and still permits confirmed completion. A previously attempted retry_wait becomes review, not “never executed.” Review/query/manual actions retain the original key and audit evidence; a full review console is outside this example. Per-run generations are not resource fences across jobs: shared resources need tokens from a common monotonic authority enforced by that resource.'))
body+=sec('Misfire：先保留原窗口，再控制恢复速度','Misfire: retain original intervals and bound recovery',bi('错过未物化火点与同一 run 的执行重试是两件事。恢复例为 [09:00,11:00) UTC：每个分钟 job 有 120 个旧槽，十个共 1,200；11:00 正常火点另算。skip、coalesce、catch_up 是每个 job 的互斥选择，不能把三行当连续三次执行。','Recovering unmaterialized occurrences differs from retrying an existing run. In [09:00,11:00) UTC, each minute job has 120 missed slots, giving 1,200 for ten jobs; the live 11:00 occurrence is separate. skip, coalesce and catch_up are alternative per-job policies, not three sequential executions.')+figs[3]+bi('skip 记录放弃范围，适合只看当前状态的巡检。coalesce 用最后一个旧火点的稳定身份，输入冻结整个遗漏区间，handler 必须真能覆盖它。catch_up 按原计划逐火点生成；每页最多 100，页内 run、审计与游标同事务。首个活跃火点 cutoff 在本次恢复过程中固定，剩余页不能因「现在没那么迟」就退出。','skip audits abandonment and suits current-state checks. coalesce uses the last missed occurrence identity with a frozen complete interval that the handler must actually cover. catch_up creates original occurrences in pages of at most 100; each page commits runs, audit and cursor together. Pin the first live occurrence cutoff throughout that recovery pass, continuing remaining pages even when they no longer appear very late.')+code('misfire.pseudo','Pseudocode · recurring misfire pages')+bi('这段只处理周期 calendar；calendar.first_live_fire 按该定义的原相位和容忍阈值找首个仍可正常调度的火点，不能用 epoch 取模代替。例如火点 30、90、150 秒，恢复时刻 180 秒且容忍为零，下一个是 210 秒，合并身份是 150 秒。一次性任务默认补做原 deadline，T1 留原身份并将 next_run_at 置 null；若产品允许丢弃，须显式记录 skipped，不能因没有下一 cron 点而漏掉它。','This routine is for recurring calendars. calendar.first_live_fire respects the definition’s original phase and lateness tolerance, rather than epoch modulo. For fires at seconds 30, 90 and 150, recovery at 180 with zero tolerance gives next=210 and coalesced identity=150. A one-shot defaults to materializing its original deadline, retaining identity and setting next_run_at=null. Dropping it requires an explicit audited skip policy; absence of a next cron instant must not lose it.')+bi('恢复预算是 100−80=20/s，1,200÷20=60 秒只是在恒定流量、无额外失败和开销下的理想下界；正常已占 100/s 就没有排空余量。对账可合并 [watermark,cutoff)，但 cutoff 必须有数据完整性证据，水位只随已持久完成的连续前缀推进。恢复新火点与已有 unknown run 的查证都要限速。','Spare capacity is 100−80=20/s, so 1,200/20=60 s is an ideal lower bound under constant load with no additional failure or overhead. At 100/s live load there is no drain capacity. Reconciliation can process [watermark,cutoff), but cutoff needs completeness evidence and the watermark advances only over a durably finished contiguous prefix. Rate-limit both new recovery occurrences and investigation of unknown runs.')+details('产品示例只支持它们自己的默认值','Product examples have version-specific defaults',bi('Quartz 2.3.0 JobStoreTX 的 misfireThreshold 默认 60000 ms；Airflow 3.0.0 的 catchup_by_default=False。这些是公开产品配置，不是本章迟到 SLO、租约 TTL 或全行业默认；选 skip 还是补齐仍由业务窗口要求决定。[5][6]','Quartz 2.3.0 JobStoreTX documents a default misfireThreshold of 60000 ms; Airflow 3.0.0 documents catchup_by_default=False. These product settings are not our lateness SLO, lease TTL or universal defaults. Business interval requirements decide skip versus recovery. [5][6]')))
body+=sec('延迟任务：时间轮是提示，截止点才是事实','Delayed jobs: a wheel is a hint; the deadline is durable',bi('30 分钟关单先持久保存绝对 UTC deadline=创建时刻+1,800 秒。用 due 索引分页轮询已经足够时，不加时间轮。第五组的 Timer index 可以丢失与重建；候选必须带 job_id、版本和 deadline，回权威行核对 enabled、当前版本和到期条件，再走 T1。旧槽或重复提示不能直接调用 handler。','Persist an absolute UTC deadline of creation time plus 1,800 s for a 30-minute close. Omit a timing wheel when indexed due polling is sufficient. Deck five’s Timer index is rebuildable; hints carry job_id, version and deadline, checked against authoritative enabled/version/due state before T1. Stale or duplicate hints cannot invoke the handler directly.')+figs[4]+bi('1 秒×60 槽只有 60 秒范围；1,800 mod 60=0 表示三十圈后落同槽，不是立即到期。可保留 rounds、用分层轮或只装近窗，最后仍比较绝对 deadline。Netty 4.1 把 HashedWheelTimer 定位为近似 I/O 超时；它没有承诺业务准点执行或持久恢复。[7] 重启分页重建未来提示，并另扫停机期间到期的定义；只重建未来会漏一次性任务。','A 1 s×60-slot wheel spans 60 s. 1,800 mod 60=0 means the same slot thirty revolutions later, not immediate expiry. Use rounds, hierarchy or near-window loading, then check the absolute deadline. Netty 4.1 describes approximate I/O timeout scheduling, not punctual business execution or durability. [7] Rebuild future hints in pages and separately scan deadlines missed during downtime; future-only reconstruction loses one-shot jobs.')+bi('cron 保存 IANA 时区与明确 DST 策略，火点存 UTC；每天某本地时刻不等于每隔 86,400 秒。前跳的不存在时刻与后退的两次时刻如何处理必须写入定义，固定时区规则版本后枚举。[11] DB 时间用于到期和租约，本地经过时间用单调时钟；大幅授时异常影响及时性，不能靠代次修好时间。','Cron stores an IANA timezone and explicit DST policy; occurrences store UTC. A fixed local daily time is not always an 86,400 s interval. Define omitted and repeated local-time behavior and enumerate with pinned timezone rules. [11] Use database time for due/lease decisions and monotonic time for local elapsed time. Generations do not repair timeliness under large authority-clock errors.'))
body+=sec('业务 T2：稳定键、状态条件与 Outbox 一起提交','Business T2: commit key, state predicate and outbox together',bi('第六组把跨库边界留在图上：Schedule DB 不参加 Order DB 的 T2。close:o7 在该租户下标识同一个关单意图，所有 attempt、旧 worker 和人工恢复都保持它。接收端验证身份和参数后，在订单行锁内检查状态与真正业务截止点；只有确定结果才保存可重复回放的回执。[8]','Deck six keeps the database boundary explicit: Schedule DB does not join Order DB’s T2. Tenant-scoped close:o7 identifies one closure intent across attempts, stale workers and manual recovery. After identity/input verification, the receiver checks order state and the authoritative business deadline while holding the order row lock, saving a replayable receipt only for a confirmed result. [8]')+figs[5]+code('close_order.pseudo','Pseudocode · business transaction and outbox')+bi('本例订单的 PAID/CLOSED 是不可重新打开的终态；canonical_payload 由已验证 order_id 和操作构造，不包含 attempt_id。同租户、同 key 不同参数返回冲突。提前叫醒但尚未到业务 deadline 时返回 RETRY_AT，<strong>不能保存“无需关闭”回执</strong>，否则到真正截止点仍会一直重放早期 no-op。worker 对 RETRY_AT 重新安排原操作，不标 succeeded。','PAID/CLOSED are non-reopenable terminal states in this example. canonical_payload is constructed from validated order identity and operation, without attempt_id. Same-tenant/same-key changed input conflicts. An early wake-up returns RETRY_AT without saving a terminal no-op receipt; otherwise later legitimate closure would replay that early no-op forever. The worker reschedules the original operation on RETRY_AT rather than marking success.')+bi('T2 已提交、响应丢失或 run 完成写丢失：保留 unknown，用同键取得原结果，再由当前代次完成 run。run succeeded 在本章指订单已关闭或已处于不需关闭的终态；通知另看 outbox。Relay 发送后记 delivered 前崩溃会重投，Event sink 必须把非空唯一 (tenant,event_id) inbox 与本地效果同事务提交再 ACK。[9]','If T2 commits but the reply or run completion write is lost, retain uncertainty, retrieve the original same-key result, then complete using the current generation. Here succeeded means closed or an already terminal no-op; notification progress belongs to outbox. A relay crash after sending but before delivered bookkeeping resends the event. The sink commits a non-null unique (tenant,event_id) inbox and its local effect together before ACK. [9]')+bi('该证明只保护支持本地事务/幂等契约的接收端。普通邮件接口没有发送幂等键时，Outbox 仍可能重复发邮件；取消、超时和调度租约不能撤回它。业务去重期限覆盖所有可能重放，关单键保留到订单归档，不随七天 run 历史一起删除。Kubernetes CronJob 也明确近似调度可重复或漏建，要求幂等；并发策略只约束同一 CronJob。[10]','The proof applies only to receivers supporting the local transaction/idempotency contract. A plain email interface without send idempotency may still send twice through an outbox; cancellation, timeout and scheduler leases cannot undo it. Effect retention covers every permitted replay: keep close keys until order archival independently of seven-day run history. Kubernetes CronJob likewise documents approximate creation with duplicates or omissions, requiring idempotency; concurrency policies apply within a CronJob. [10]'))
body+=sec('复盘与可运行验证','Review and executable checks',bi('口述四个落点：T1 留唯一 ready 与游标；claim 留当前代次与租约；超时留原键和未知结果；业务 T2 留效果、回执与事件。扩规模先指出扫描、执行还是下游预算不足，跨地域先定唯一权威。','Name four durable facts: T1’s unique ready row and cursor; the claim’s generation and lease; the original key and uncertainty after timeout; and business T2’s effect, receipt and event. Scale the exhausted scan, execution or downstream budget; establish authority before adding regions.')+bi('六段是教学 SQL/伪代码，不是可编译 Java。<a href="../examples/ch25/README.md">examples/ch25</a> 提供 Python 3 标准库 SQLite 适配器与同源校验：实际两连接事务、回滚、过期旧写、取消、偏移相位、Outbox 跨库重投均可执行。SQLite BEGIN IMMEDIATE 串行写者，比 PostgreSQL 行锁更粗；fixture_clock 是受控测试行，calendar 只实现 UTC 固定间隔和一次性，未验证真实 PG SKIP LOCKED、授时、复制切主、网络故障或生产吞吐。[13]','These six blocks are teaching SQL/pseudocode, not compilable Java. <a href="../examples/ch25/README.md">examples/ch25</a> provides a Python 3 standard-library SQLite adapter and source checks, executing real two-connection transactions, rollback, stale writes, cancellation, shifted phases and cross-database outbox replay. SQLite BEGIN IMMEDIATE serializes writers more coarsely than PostgreSQL row locks. fixture_clock is a controlled test row; the calendar fixture implements UTC fixed intervals and one-shot jobs only. Real PG SKIP LOCKED, clocks, replication/failover, network failures and production throughput remain untested. [13]'))
refs=re.search(r'<ol class="references">[\s\S]*?</ol>',original).group().replace('2026-10-06','2026-10-23')
refs=refs.replace('</ol>', '<li id="ref12">[12] PostgreSQL Global Development Group, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/functions-datetime.html#FUNCTIONS-DATETIME-CURRENT">PostgreSQL 18 · Current Date/Time</a> · <span class="lang-zh">now/CURRENT_TIMESTAMP 为事务起点；clock_timestamp 为实际取样时间，2026-10-23 核验。</span><span class="lang-en">now/CURRENT_TIMESTAMP uses transaction start; clock_timestamp samples actual time. Verified 2026-10-23.</span></li>\n<li id="ref13">[13] SQLite, <a href="https://www.sqlite.org/lang_transaction.html">Transaction</a> · <span class="lang-zh">真实单写者与 BEGIN IMMEDIATE 的验证边界，2026-10-23 核验。</span><span class="lang-en">Single-writer and BEGIN IMMEDIATE validation boundary. Verified 2026-10-23.</span></li></ol>')
body+=sec('引用与延伸','References and follow-ups',refs+'<p class="cite"><a class="chip" href="ch08.html">Ch08</a> <a class="chip" href="ch18.html">Ch18</a> <a class="chip" href="ch24.html">Ch24</a> <a class="chip" href="ch34.html">Ch34</a> <a class="chip" href="ch41.html">Ch41</a></p>')
cards=[
('唯一火点能保证 handler 只调用一次吗？','Does one occurrence mean one handler call?','不能。UNIQUE 约束一行 run；attempt 可重复，业务效果由稳定键和接收端事务保护。','No. UNIQUE protects one run row; attempts repeat, while stable keys and receiver transactions protect effects.'),
('T1 为什么不能先推进游标再发线程池？','Why not advance the cursor then enqueue in memory?','两步之间崩溃会丢火点；ready、冻结输入与下一游标同事务，提交后可重投。','A crash in between loses work. Commit ready, frozen input and cursor together, then retry delivery.'),
('改版后已有 run 读哪个参数？','Which input does an existing run use after an edit?','用自己的冻结 payload/effect_key，不读最新 job 参数；新版本不自动授权第二次业务效果。','Use its own frozen payload/effect_key, not new job input. A new version does not automatically authorize another effect.'),
('为什么 166.7/s 仍可能排几十秒？','Why can 166.7/s still cause tens of seconds of queueing?','整分钟 10,000 同时到期；固定0.2秒、56槽需179轮，即35.8秒，其他开销另算。','10,000 align at a minute boundary. At fixed 0.2s with 56 slots, 179 rounds take 35.8s, plus overhead.'),
('56 槽与七天历史怎么算？','How are 56 slots and seven-day history derived?','ceil((10000÷60)×0.2÷0.6)=56；14.4M×200B×7=20.16GB原始，不含索引等。','ceil((10000/60)×0.2/0.6)=56; 14.4M×200B×7=20.16GB raw, excluding indexes and extras.'),
('为什么不能用事务开始 now 判续租？','Why not use transaction-start now for renewal?','等行锁可能跨过租约截止点；持锁后采样 clock_timestamp，再校验状态、owner、generation 与 lease。','Waiting for the row lock may cross expiry. Sample clock_timestamp after locking, then check state, owner, generation and lease.'),
('A 代次41，B接管为42后会怎样？','What happens after B replaces generation 41 with 42?','A 的心跳/完成被权威行拒绝，但已发外部动作仍需业务幂等；单run代次不是跨job资源fence。','Authority rejects A heartbeat/completion, but in-flight effects still need receiver idempotency. A per-run generation is not a cross-job resource fence.'),
('超时五次或取消运行中任务，能说从未执行吗？','Do five timeouts or running cancellation prove no execution?','不能。保留原键、unknown与review；取消未尝试ready才可记cancelled，确定效果仍可完成。','No. Retain the original key, uncertainty and review. Only unattempted ready can be cancelled as unstarted; confirmed effects may still complete.'),
('1200次补偿为什么至少60秒？','Why does 1200-run recovery need at least 60 seconds?','[09:00,11:00)每job120槽；十个1200。预算100/s减正常80/s余20/s，理想1200÷20=60。','[09:00,11:00) has 120 slots per job, 1200 for ten. Spare capacity is 100−80=20/s; ideal drain is 60s.'),
('分页补偿的 cutoff 与任务相位怎么保留？','How do recovery pages retain cutoff and phase?','首次固定cutoff，剩余页继续；30/90/150秒火点在180秒恢复，下一个210，合并身份150，不能按epoch取模。','Pin cutoff until pages finish. Fires 30/90/150s recovered at 180s give next=210 and coalesce=150; epoch modulo changes the schedule.'),
('时间轮重启只装未来够吗？','Is future-only wheel rebuilding sufficient?','不够，还扫停机到期定义；一次性默认补原deadline，T1留原身份并置next=null。','No. Also scan deadlines missed during downtime. A one-shot defaults to its original deadline and sets next=null in T1.'),
('提前关单为何不存 no-op 回执？','Why not save a no-op receipt on early closure?','它会让真正到期后仍重放早期no-op。返回RETRY_AT，不存终态回执；已支付等终态才可持久no-op。','It would replay forever after the real deadline. Return RETRY_AT without a terminal receipt; paid/closed terminal states may save a no-op.'),
('T2成功但run完成回包丢失如何恢复？','How is lost run completion recovered after T2 commits?','订单端同键取原结果，再用当前代次完成run；两个库不假装同事务，通知进度另看outbox。','Read the original same-key order result, then complete with the current generation. The databases are separate; outbox tracks notifications.'),
('Outbox为何仍需接收端inbox？','Why does outbox still require receiver inbox?','发送后记delivered前会重投；接收端非空唯一事件键与本地效果同事务再ACK。','A crash before delivery bookkeeping resends. Commit a non-null unique event key and local effect together before ACK.')]
cardhtml='<p class="cite"><span class="lang-zh">点按或用 Enter/Space 翻面；回答时说出持久记录、键与失败边界。</span><span class="lang-en">Click or press Enter/Space; name the durable row, key and failure boundary.</span></p><div class="cards-grid">\n'
for qz,qe,az,ae in cards:cardhtml+='<button type="button" class="flip"><span class="q"><span class="lang-zh">'+qz+'</span><span class="lang-en">'+qe+'</span></span><span class="a"><span class="lang-zh">'+az+'</span><span class="lang-en">'+ae+'</span></span></button>\n'
body+=sec('闪卡','Flashcards',cardhtml+'</div>')
head=original[:original.index('<section>')].replace('约 40 分钟','约 45 分钟').replace('~40 min','~45 min')
tail=original[original.index('  <p><button type="button" class="read-toggle"'):]
# No other writer may have changed the page while the rewrite was prepared.
assert p.read_text()==original
p.write_text(head+body+tail)
print('Ch25 rewritten; six original decks retained')
